      "writtenOn": "2024-01-23T04:18:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Without BOARD_VNDK_VERSION after the VNDK deprecation, vendor modules no longer set VNDK version property with the image variant. That made useVndk() false.\nSo I wonder if I missed some cases here.",
      "parentUuid": "7c1c15ac_27af2dd5",
